            <div xml:id="d629">

                <pb facs="0944" n="824" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg824"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003 C 73/26</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Woods</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-28"><hi rendition="#italic">November 28,
                        1922</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received December 12.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 399</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to the Department’s circular
                    telegraphic instruction of May 4th, 6 P.M., and to its circular telegram of May
                    27th, 6 P.M.,<anchor n="96" xml:id="d629-f1"/> relative to the establishment of
                    a commission to inquire into the present practice of extra-territorial
                    jurisdiction in China, I have the honor to inform the Department that I did not
                    fail promptly to bring the contents of the two instructions in question to the
                    attention of the Spanish Government, and to transmit herewith, in copy and
                    translation, a self-explanatory Note, No. 145 of November 7th,<anchor n="97"
                        xml:id="d629-f2"/> but received on November 25th, from the Minister of
                    State, by which the Embassy is informed that the Spanish Government adheres to
                    the agreement contained in the Department’s telegraphic instructions under
                    acknowledgment.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cyrus E. Woods</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
